OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 7 MAR
OL,4,G0300FThe Women Who Rock!
OL,5,     GTony Blackburn, begins with a
OL,6,     Glook at the groundbreaking 60s,
OL,7,     Gwhere Tina Turner, Grace Slick,
OL,8,     GNico, PP Arnold and Janis Joplin
OL,9,     Gled the charge when it came to
OL,10,     Grock vocals.
OL,11,G0330FThe Women Who Rock!
OL,12,     GBob Harris takes us through the
OL,13,     G70s, focusing on the rise of rock
OL,14,     Ggiants like Stevie Nicks, Pattie
OL,15,     GSmith, Suzi Quatro, Christine
OL,16,     GMcVie and Debbie Harry, who
OL,17,     Ginfluenced a generation.
